== The Wanderer: Modlist

Wave 0 adds no content. Every mod in this chapter only makes the game easier to see, smoother to run, or less tedious to operate — nothing here raises your stats, your damage, or your income beyond what vanilla Kenshi allows, and nothing adds new weapons, armour, or factions. Think of it as polishing the window before you step through it.

*Install order:* subscribe to all six, then in the KMM Mods tab drag *Compressed Textures Project* to the very top and *Kenshi CTD fix patch* to the very bottom; the rest can sit between them.

The six mods are split across the next two sections by what they change. *Mechanics* covers the four engine/performance mods (Compressed Textures Project, Particle System Override, Kenshi Performance Fix, Kenshi CTD fix patch) — nothing that touches balance, just smoother and more stable running. *Graphics* covers the two readability mods (Dark UI and Nice Map) — how the game looks, not how it plays.
